<div
    class="w-full overflow-visible bg-black text-white flex flex-col bg-no-repeat bg-center bg-cover"
    style="background-image: url('images/04_Image_BG_01.webp');"
>
    <div class="pt-16 pb-[180px] px-[10%] justify-center flex">
        <div class="max-w-[2000px]">
            <div class="flex justify-end" id="features">
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 md:pl-[8.4%] xl:pr-40">
                    <h2 class="text-6xl md:text-7xl py-4">Features and Technology</h2>
                    <p class="py-3 text-2xl text-[#CB8337]">
                        The Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 combine their premium
                        materials and stylish interior designs with the high level
                        of technology expected from modern flagship SUVs.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-4">
                        The immersive 12.3-inch multi-information displays change
                        dynamically as you drive, while the head-up displays keeps
                        essential driving and navigation information in your line of
                        sight, reducing the need to glance away from the road.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-4">
                        The central infotainment display – available in either
                        10.25-inches or 12.3-inches depending on the model you
                        choose – is ideally positioned when navigating through the
                        city, managing your playlists, or just when you need to make
                        a call.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-4">
                        It’s all done with a touch, tap, or swipe, or even your
                        voice, just like your smartphone​​.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-4">
                        For both Apple and Android users, wireless Apple CarPlay and
                        Android Auto are there to make sure you’re always connected
                        in the most seamless way possible.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-4">
                        The premium 12-speaker Bose surround sound systems makes
                        every journey feel like a concert, with your favourite
                        tracks sounding crisp, clear, and perfectly balanced.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="[background-color:rgba(203,131,55,0.5)] flex justify-center backdrop-blur-xl[z-index:100] border-b-black border-b"
    >
                        
        <div class="text-contet-driver-system flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row max-w-[2000px]">
                        <div
                            class="w-full md:w-1/2 md:pr-2 md:pt-[140px] pb-10 px-[10%] md:pl-[10%] xl:pr-12"
                        >
                            <h3 class="text-4xl py-3 font-bold">
                                Driver Personalisation System
                            </h3>
                            <p
                                class="py-2 text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light text-orange-100 md:text-white"
                            >
                                Imagine - stepping into a car that recognises you, not just
                                metaphorically, but literally. The Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90’s
                                Driver Personalisation System does just that.
                            </p>
                            <p class="py-4 font-light">
                                Simply select your height on the display during setup, and the
                                car uses a camera to find your eyes and automatically adjusts
                                the seat, steering wheel, head-up display, and mirror positions
                                just for you.
                            </p>
                            <p class="py-4 font-light">
                                Even your radio pre-sets and climate control settings will be
                                remembered, perfect if you share the driving with others.
                            </p>
                            <p class="py-4 font-light">
                                From this point forward, every time you slip into the driver’s
                                seat the Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 will use facial recognition
                                to identify you, automatically returning everything to your
                                saved positions without you having to touch a thing.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 pr-2">
                            <img
                                class="relative inline-block my-4 md:my-0 [top:-100px] md:[top:-40px] px-12 md:px-20"
                                src="images/04_Image_Still_01.webp"
                                alt=""
                            />
                            <img
                                class="relative inline-block md:[top:auto] [top:-50px] md:[bottom:-40px] px-12 md:px-20"
                                src="images/04_Image_Still_02.webp"
                                alt=""
                            />
                        </div>

        </div>



    </div>
</div>